  Digital terrain model 2021, © Paradigm (paradigm.brussels), CC0 1.0
    (terrain.u16, terrain.json; tree heights in features.json)

  UrbIS Digital surface model 2021, © Paradigm (paradigm.brussels), CC0 1.0
    (tree positions, heights and crowns in features.json)

The Paradigm datasets are public domain (CC0 1.0); they are credited as a
courtesy and add no conditions. buildings.* and terrain.* contain no
OpenStreetMap data. See ../CREDITS.md for sources, versions and the dates the
licences were checked.

This licence covers the data only. Code in this repository is licensed
separately.
